  "description": "Jin Gyeong-tae enjoys toying with celebrities he takes a liking to, only to discard them once he loses interest.\nThis time, his attention turns to Ryu Tae-on, a rookie actor.\nAfter laying the groundwork, Gyeong-tae is just about to have his fun with Tae-on when he suddenly loses consciousness.\nWhen he wakes up, he finds himself imprisoned in an unfamiliar place.\nAnd something feels off.\nThere is a mysterious third person watching Gyeong-tae from within the place where he is being held captive...\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078472)",
